Comment: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:39.87,main,,0,0,0,,[OP]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:10.62,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,My dear fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:12.89,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:17.82,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's been a little over a month \Nsince my life here at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:20.10,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,magic capital of Dirashik started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:24.46,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I've finally gotten used to school life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:33.09,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I've made a female friend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:39.22,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,To gain experience and become a \Ngentleman who is worthy of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.13,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I work hard every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:49.55,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:54.74,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:57.44,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,I'm Elia Hesson of Ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.77,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Can I interest you in our faction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:01.41,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Why don't you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:06.23,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,Wow, she's sparkly and pretty and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:09.94,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone like her\Nin the countryside where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:12.05,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,My heart is starting to race.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:15.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm more interested in \Nyou than the faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:18.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Would that be an impure reason to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:21.43,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Great, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:27.06,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,People at school often tell me that \Nmy idea of a gentleman is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:29.45,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,What do you think, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:06.22,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,FAIRIES CHECKING THE ANSWER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:06.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Conflict?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:10.04,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Right. Ability, Rationality, and Harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:14.89,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,These three factions used \Nto be in conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:16.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:18.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think you can fly higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.03,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:26.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, let's keep you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:35.56,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,They still get heated up \Nwhen it comes to magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:38.57,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,but it seems they settled down \Ninto more of a friendly rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.87,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I'm glad this is a peaceful time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:47.05,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Recently, I'm having a lot of fun \Ndoing experiments with you, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:48.35,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.18,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:58.45,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,The girl from Ability \Nwas also very cute, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:02.54,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,I'm Elva Daglight from Harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:07.69,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,Would you like... to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:12.23,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,A lady who shines seductively \Nlike polished obsidian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:17.61,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,I think she's still a teenager, but \Nher glamour is making me dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:20.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Why ask such a silly question?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:24.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Princess of the moonlight, \Neverything shall be as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:25.24,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.76,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:34.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your magical power is wavering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:37.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you want to fly long distances, \Nyou need to learn to keep it stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:39.48,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:42.76,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,But Kunon! She was from Harmony!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:44.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:47.07,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,W-Wouldn't that be two-timing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:49.39,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Kunon, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:55.64,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,She's super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.87,0:04:59.65,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Who the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.05,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,I'm Cassis of Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:05.53,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Will you join us, please?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:08.16,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,An exceptionally pretty \Ngirl's exceptional smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.33,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,I'm glad I came to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:14.29,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:16.92,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,What is up with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.92,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Please, Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:21.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're starting to wobble \Na lot out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:23.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You have to focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:24.67,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:29.80,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,L-Listen, Kunon. Would you like \Nto join Rationality?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Huh? Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:31.88,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:32.47,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Riyah, why don't we finish up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:39.41,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:42.55,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.46,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,This wasn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:54.08,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Of course two-timing isn't commendable, \Nand three-timing is even worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:55.47,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,but a request from such a cute—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:57.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I would've agreed if a lady had asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.49,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,What?! Then...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.69,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I thought that was the \Ncutest of the three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:05.31,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,The city sure is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:07.22,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Ah, the sleeping beauty \Nfrom the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.64,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,H-Hello, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:15.86,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Hello. Riyah, I heard you're \Njoining Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:17.63,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,It's good to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:19.14,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Kunon, would you like to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:20.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:23.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No gentleman would decline \Nan invitation from a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:27.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If there is one, I'd do a \Ndouble take at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:29.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Although I couldn't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:32.78,main,HANK,0,0,0,,He agreed to join three factions?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:34.27,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:37.61,main,HANK,0,0,0,,They will not be happy if they find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:41.79,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Right. Even if things are peaceful now,\N he can't do that, can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.73,0:06:48.30,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.75,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,You did it, Elia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:56.30,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,As expected of the biggest \Nboy magnet of the faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.30,0:06:58.31,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,A pretty girl even the goddess \Nof beauty would stare at!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.83,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Please stop that, Mr. Bael.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:01.97,main,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Nice going, pretty girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.97,0:07:04.22,main,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Even though a pretty girl with \Na pure heart is fictional!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:05.70,main,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Go out with me, pretty girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.25,main,BOY 3,0,0,0,,No, go out with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:09.78,main,BOY 3,0,0,0,,You can cuss me out \Nand dump me on the first date!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.45,main,BOY 4,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask your hand for marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.57,main,BOY 4,0,0,0,,Let's pay back a debt of \N500 million necca together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:16.79,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Celebrate more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:21.48,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,You've managed the difficult task \Nof securing a promising newcomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:22.96,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Mr. Bael!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:25.56,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I worked hard, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.34,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Yeah, good job! You did well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:29.84,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,Thank you very much—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:33.46,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Now Ability is in stable condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:39.01,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,Please don't show up out \Nof nowhere, Mr. Genevis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.01,0:07:40.44,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:42.84,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:48.44,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,He's actually a good guy, but the way\N he talks is kind of annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.01,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.52,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Yeah. Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:58.42,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,However... there's an unsettling rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:00.75,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,A rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.25,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Damn you, Ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:09.08,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:12.94,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,I wish you didn't barge \Nin without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:17.08,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,As always, the way you talk \Npisses me off, Genevis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.38,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:23.54,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Ms. Sandra is as scary as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:26.78,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,So full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:28.54,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Is that because you had meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.94,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Huh?! Are you picking fight with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:35.83,main - italics,ELIA/I,0,0,0,,He's not really a bad \Nperson. Just annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.19,0:08:37.95,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Did you need something, Lulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.63,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Yes, actually—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:41.20,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Like hell he needs something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.77,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,That uggo over there is spreading \Nbullshit that she succeeded
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:47.32,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,in recruiting Kunon, \Nso we came to complain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.86,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,What?! It's not bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.34,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,And I'm not ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:52.65,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Shut up, ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.44,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Everyone is ugly except for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.84,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Learn to align your attitude \Nwith your ugly mug!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:57.84,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.55,main,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Elia is a sweet girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:02.09,main,BOY 2,0,0,0,,That's right! A sweet girl in love!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:04.35,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,I-I'm not in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:06.54,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Sweet? Oh, please! More like stinky feet—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.16,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Cassis, stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.04,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Or I can't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.76,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Please excuse him, Elia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:16.11,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,He likes to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.12,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.47,main - italics,ELIA/I,0,0,0,,Hm? That's not an apology, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.87,0:09:23.91,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,And what did you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:27.00,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,We determined the order of \Nrecruitment fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:32.88,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Yes. But there is an unsettling rumor, \Nso we came to check the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:34.28,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,A rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:38.82,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Shilto should be heading here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.26,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:55.03,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,As we agreed, we approached \NKunon Gurion in the order of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.03,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Ability, Harmony, and Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:10:00.14,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Yes, and that's why we—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:03.21,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,He said yes to all three factions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.12,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:09.83,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Technically, Ability \Nfailed the initial approach,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.73,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,but the second student succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:13.25,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.25,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:18.55,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Why not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:20.74,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,This is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:24.81,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,It seems... we've got someone \Ntruly out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:29.62,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Is he serious, or is it all lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:32.19,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,We'll just have to ask him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:10:59.31,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,The master of the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.80,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,Let's run, Princess Mirika!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:02.80,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:08.67,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,There's a village up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:11.48,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,So I have to stop it right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:40.94,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Dear brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:43.05,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,Prince Lyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:46.31,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,You've got guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:49.43,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,That's what I expect from the \Nvice captain of the Wild Bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:50.93,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.91,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I still have much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:06.70,main,MAID 1,0,0,0,,Coming back after the sun has set?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:09.22,main,MAID 2,0,0,0,,Where does she go out to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:13.58,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:14.96,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm home, Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.45,0:12:19.90,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,You received a missive from the senior \Nschool for nobles about the final exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:22.86,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:26.22,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,And another letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:30.39,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,From Kunon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:53.85,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,"My dear fiancée." Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:57.79,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,So he's doing a lot of magic experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.13,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,A bacon-making experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:06.04,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I see you still like bacon, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:06.77,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:09.14,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:14.14,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,He's made a female friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.90,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,She must be his classmate. \NNothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:24.40,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,R-Right, nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:29.03,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.87,0:13:39.88,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I'd like to start a \Nhousehold account book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:41.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:45.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And why do you need my shopping memos?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:48.19,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Keeping precise records \Nof income and expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:51.48,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,is the most important \Nthing in making money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:54.13,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,What do you do with the \Nmoney you make at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:56.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I chuck it into the drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:57.46,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,And the receipts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:00.90,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You've bought stuff like seeds of \Nwhatever and lots of meat, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:07.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I don't have the receipts, but I \Nwrote down all income and expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:09.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's part of a noble's education.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:11.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I was told to keep good records.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:13.87,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,That makes it easier!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:15.17,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Please give me those memos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:15.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:19.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hmm, where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.39,0:14:22.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I piled stuff up too high in\N my lab and it all fell down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:23.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,so I haven't touched it since.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.59,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:26.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wow, scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:28.59,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Go through it and find them all, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:31.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:35.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm not good at organizing \Nand keeping things tidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:41.10,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon! You'll be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:42.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.36,main,BAKER,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:51.36,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.74,main,GENERAL STORE OWNER,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.77,0:14:58.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your voice is as beautiful as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:15:02.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's as if I can also hear the beautiful \Nvoice in your beautiful heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:14.64,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:17.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good morning, Miss Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:20.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That bacon...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:21.98,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Hide yourself, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hank, that bacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:26.79,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I came up with the idea last night \Nand made it first thing this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:27.55,main,HANK,0,0,0,,But whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:29.64,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Now's not the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:32.46,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,The seniors from the factions \Nare looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:33.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:37.16,main,HANK,0,0,0,,You saying yes to all the factions \Nhas become a huge problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:38.68,main,HANK,0,0,0,,If they find you, who knows what—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:40.00,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:45.78,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Come with me. \NThe representative is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:52.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you,\N one who is passionate like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm happy to follow you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:55.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wait, are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:57.31,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:59.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If it's only a little, then no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:06.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Mmm, tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:09.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is Hank's new bacon sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:10.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Would you like some, ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:13.51,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:14.95,main - italics,CICELY/I,0,0,0,,Finish it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:19.20,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,How can he be so calm in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:23.17,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Today's smoked fish isn't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:27.29,main,REYES,0,0,0,,It doesn't make me nauseous, \Nand it's just salty enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:31.25,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should consider \Nsmoking fish more often?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:33.09,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,Business as usual over here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:35.28,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Fish is tasty as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:40.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but the ocean is far from here, \Nso we don't get fresh fish often.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:43.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Apparently, sorcerers \Nwho have traveled far
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.52,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,sometimes bring back frozen seafood \Nto make some pocket money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:49.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Those are the only times you \Ncan get fish around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:52.11,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Is that so? How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:56.36,main,REYES,0,0,0,,But do you think freshwater \Nfish can be farmed near here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:58.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:00.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Maybe look for research \Nreports at the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:06.43,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Kunon, if I find the reports and it seems \Nit could be done, would you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.43,0:17:06.81,main - italics top,HANK/I,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Please go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It'd be my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:15.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How lucky am I to be \Nescorted by so many fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:18.47,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:20.91,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,W-Will he be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:23.76,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Granted, I don't see how \Nhe could be, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:26.01,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Did you see fairies somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:28.90,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Oh... That was a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:35.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.56,0:17:38.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was a castle\N like this on the school grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:39.89,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Shut up and walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:46.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you'll escort me, I'll stay \Nquiet and follow you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:48.77,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Then talk more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:52.63,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,He's here, representative!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.17,0:18:02.14,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Welcome. I am Bael Kirkington, \Nrepresentative of Ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.89,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,and we use this castle as a base.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:07.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:10.40,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,So these are representatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:12.30,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,First, let me apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:16.07,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for summoning you like this \Nwhen you don't belong to any faction yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:20.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm honored to have been invited. \NThank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:27.16,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I think it's some massive creature,\N but it's too big to really tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:30.65,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,But I trust you know \Nwhy you were summoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:35.05,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,My name is Lulomet, and I'm the \Nrepresentative of Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:36.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:39.35,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,A dark tree like a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:42.55,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,First time seeing a person with a plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:45.81,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,I'm the representative of Harmony, Shilto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:54.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:57.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I hope you can make time to spend with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.22,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:18:58.98,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:04.70,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Hey, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:07.22,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Do you realize the situation you're in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:09.51,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,This is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.51,main - top,LUKOMET,0,0,0,,Sandra.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:12.33,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Because of you, three factions \Nare about to get into a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:13.71,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,How are you going to settle this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:16.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please don't fight over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:18.65,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:20.72,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Water attribute?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I have a feeling we'll get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:25.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sure the magic you use is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:26.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Do you have time after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:28.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Would you like to talk about magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:31.98,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,He's... crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.88,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,He indulges women and \Nis weak against women.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:39.14,main,LUKOMET,0,0,0,,It's just as the report said...\NNo, it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:43.88,main,LUKOMET,0,0,0,,It seems it'll be faster \Nto speak to him via Shilto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:45.02,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:52.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Questioned by you, I may tell \Nmore than you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How about we do this over some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:01.54,main,LUKOMET,0,0,0,,Let's do that. This might take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:02.52,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.55,0:20:12.43,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I am Genevis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:16.42,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Please feel free to call \Nme Geneva with affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:22.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,N-Nice to meet you, Mr. Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:25.91,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,An evil spirit. No, a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:28.47,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:31.37,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Could it be my laughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:36.28,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,Sorry. I just can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:56.19,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,So which faction will you \Nchoose at the end of the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.09,0:21:07.24,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Earlier... That was scarier than Rinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:17.08,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Which faction do you want to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:19.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yours, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:21.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's what I wish I could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:24.59,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:27.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Many ladies have recruited me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:31.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but it's impossible for \Nme to choose just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.99,0:21:32.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:40.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm going to join all factions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:41.61,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:42.48,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:39.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode:\N "The Unprecedented Troublemaker."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.23,0:23:39.98,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: THE UNPRECEDENTED TROUBLEMAKER
